  - Fraunces (fraunces-latin-full-normal.woff2), Copyright 2018 The Fraunces
    Project Authors; license in Fraunces-OFL.txt.
  - Source Serif 4 (source-serif-4-latin-wght-normal.woff2 and
    source-serif-4-latin-wght-italic.woff2), Copyright 2014 - 2023 Adobe, with
    Reserved Font Name 'Source'; license in SourceSerif4-OFL.txt.
