    JetBrains Mono Project Authors; license in JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt.
The woff2 files are the latin variable builds published by the Fontsource
project (@fontsource-variable packages, version 5.3; all axes for Fraunces,
the weight axis for the other two), copied unchanged.
Otherwise none bundled. The two icons in mods/attention-picker
(spinner.svg, search.svg) and the preview illustration (preview.png, drawn from
scripts/preview/preview.svg) were made for this project. The illustration is
text drawn in the first font the renderer finds from this list in
scripts/preview/preview.svg: Geist, Inter, Segoe UI, DejaVu Sans, Liberation Sans,
Arial, then any sans-serif. Which one it was is not recorded in the PNG. Geist,
Inter, DejaVu Sans and Liberation Sans are open fonts; Segoe UI and Arial are
system fonts that are not bundled or distributed here, only rendered into the
picture. A real screenshot replaces the illustration before the repository is
published (see .github/PUBLISH-CHECKLIST.md).

Copies of the mod folder: keep the "SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0" and
copyright lines at the top of main.js, logic.js and ask.js, and ship the LICENSE
file with a bundled copy (a layout that includes the mod, for example).

Development tools used outside the shipped mod (not distributed with it):
Node.js (test runner), GitHub Actions.
